[cave]
Name=Welcome to Dustin's BD 25!
Author=49174
Date=2025-06-04
Intermission=true
IntermissionProperties.rewardlife=false
Story=Hi BD fans!!\n\nSo here it is, my 25th game of the series!\n\nWhen I started the DBD series, I thought I had enough ideas for two, maybe three games - well, it's become a tiny bit more by now! :D\n\nAs usual, the game is created in classical five-level style. Level 1 is not necessarily \"easy\", but it's meant to introduce Rockford into the main idea(s) behind each cave, without (m)any extra obstacles once he's figured out the general solution methods. Then when Rockford has seen each cave once, level 2 will be significantly harder versions of them, and by level 3, Rockford should already be quite good at each cave because there are usually only few bonus diamonds and/or relatively little time! Level 4 pushes the caves toward their limits, and on level 5, very few caves have any bonus diamonds at all - these are usually the caves where the maximum is not clear or it depends on randomness. I think that especially the second half of level 5 is very difficult - I haven't yet managed to play through level 5 without a Game Over!  As always, the 5 levels are meant to offer a fun and challenging game to occasional players as well as for BD experts!\n\nAlso, as usual in my games, the scoring system is supposed to give our favorite treasure seeker a reasonable amount of extra lives, not too many, not too little, such that it's challenging but not impossible to complete the game without a Game Over!\n\nUnusually, there are 8 intermissions in the game, one after each 2 caves. This is firstly because I have so many intermission ideas that I didn't want to throw half of them out, and secondly, the game has now exactly 25 caves including this intro, which I found quite nice for the jubilee! :D\n\nEnjoy the game - I definitely enjoyed creating it! :D
Size=20 12 0 0 19 11
Colors=#000000 #000000 #9b741f #72267f #12b4b7 #267f38 #3a1f9b
DiamondsRequired=25 25 25 25 25
CaveTime=25 25 25 25 25
CaveScheduling=ms
FrameTime=160 150 140 130 120
HatchingDelay=25 25 25 25 25
CaveDelay=0 0 0 0 0
DiamondValue=25 25
RandSeed=-1 -1 -1 -1 -1
